{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53464","headline":"颜鲁公挽歌词 · 柳登","name":"颜鲁公挽歌词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杀身终不恨，归丧遂如生。\n（《唐语林》卷六）（按：《唐语林》原称柳常侍作，此从周勋初先生《唐语林校证》说。\n据周考，此段文字出自韦绚《戎幕闲谈》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}